    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01997c8bf1b623ba7320c67c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Show time──对吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61cd657cd4d0f1a461b66eed510df27ab37a39d3266d18ec7660c565b15fcdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9956ca0146a2fd02e9c741e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会，我也一定会完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef3e40f0049f1b0988085c69ea095932d5664d714bdb357e03c0bb94365bede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3deafb5ea00d795b500aabf0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请你协助我达成使命──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3e78edafdf3b164bd7a0b901dbc66d4d0ad20296f23a0f75ab0bcd97ec93c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01ed8a23c480ea720a58eac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的选择──\r\n没有错。\r\n这想法……非常强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fcf2e3138548bbd6b4880c536e8a2eb4208a5a04473e05bd6dceb871b46669a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a529cac13a1ddeb05c982c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遵守校规的──服装仪容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c387693df9f6d3fffab28a138f098a1775c09a40dc940edddd3b919ac653d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202e0cfd69cb0eb61ed257f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上同款衣服──能提升团结力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b5da3fae695c722cd4280a521a42b68ce07c4374c52613a38588e70bd49e63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ec013521eccd390dcfbd7c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服真special……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe19c2ea7514eda84978e2baad53e6a710ef06ee7a948a48d70e01bf594bb26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f1dc14aac831591e61bc3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天穿一样的服装──很有效率。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01ca29f1928f8a3ce9a413bd9357e168e6fca0c92c4c76264f2504c9a9437acc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a06571adec2c05529073944",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘的衣服──我穿不习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0bd5a3ca1a97c7c9af07aefe65c39f1caecc7fc82da06ad9bfbbfa5eb7f051c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2905d0bcc896c3df65381cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身装扮──让我更有干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef82e1734a03f934d78d9c1c44b8b23b279ef49175f327a5570f93703625de7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5fd18cc9b73c33e68033f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "長い長い――時の流れを――\r\n感じさせる――衣装だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff729cdac40ec2516291fefc3957151cbf9ec69d754b10e59e03e8878bb33512",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c20008165a54e20b136f1f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんなりと、任務を。\r\n――使命感の――湧いてくる服だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3563ffe91a0125ca9228ad5fc91b949802ff91bd54eca70412094b4d973b4cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c071043bf27fe5f8d0ed6e7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "换装──就是要快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acfa5fccabd7fb93e7aa8353405e138081c219dd3681bbb4a652c85dea79d440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47caa914792e0f2ac73fadc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有需要的话──我什么都愿意穿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66f7153727a9f996a6e2544004ef7729b4266b8dca7f5f1698615b5c26c8182c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0faeb95ec51b8a524168b643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私服は――動きやすさが肝要だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfd2a938a9ac613bc0cf5b8aa0c5ec995f68176ae2d8bc6f432432576fac34cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdf46380700640b15eae5fd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ポケットが多いと――便利だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e57a0a9c8c595f21048b01302d85651b54a082d8b546aa8e49940b96e795869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
